<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Workspace konfigurasi berlapis Editor Robots.txt pada VendorDomain."><title>Editor Robots.txt · VendorDomain</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#050a14;--panel:#0b1728;--line:#29415d;--text:#eaf4ff;--muted:#9cb2cc;--accent:#73cfff;--cyan:#63e4d1}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% -10%,#14375a 0,transparent 42%),linear-gradient(180deg,#050a14,#071321 55%,#050a14);color:var(--text);font:14px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:#83dfff;text-decoration:none}button,select,input{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:#071321;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;padding:10px}button{cursor:pointer}button:hover,.nav button.active{border-color:var(--accent);background:#12304a}header{padding:18px clamp(14px,3vw,38px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#071222ef}header small,.eyebrow{color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:1.5px;font-weight:800}h1{font-size:clamp(23px,3vw,34px);margin:5px 0}header p{margin:4px 0;color:var(--muted)}.crumb{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px}main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:22px clamp(12px,2.5vw,36px) 50px}.intro,.nav,.stage{border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0d1e32,#081321)}.intro{padding:20px;margin-bottom:15px}.intro p{color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0}.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px}.nav{padding:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;align-self:start;position:sticky;top:10px}.nav button{text-align:left;background:transparent;padding:12px}.nav button span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.stage{min-width:0;padding:clamp(14px,2vw,24px)}.layer{display:none}.layer.active{display:block}.layer-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:18px}.layer-head small{color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:1.5px}.layer-head h2{margin:3px 0;font-size:22px}.layer-head p,.muted{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.layer-head b{font-size:30px;color:#315c7c}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.fields label{display:grid;gap:6px;color:#bfd0e5}.fields select{width:100%;min-height:42px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#06101d;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:15px;color:#b9d9ff}.actions,.footer-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}.import{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 12px}.import input{max-width:160px}.footer-actions{padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.status{margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border-left:3px solid var(--cyan);background:#0c2032;color:#c9e8ff}@media(max-width:700px){.workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{position:static;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.nav button{font-size:11px;padding:9px}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><header><div class="crumb"><a href="../index.html">VENDORDOMAIN</a><span>›</span><a href="../features/index.html">FITUR</a><span>›</span>SEO DAN PENEMUAN SITUS</div><small>MODUL 15 · FITUR 358 DARI 500</small><h1>Editor Robots.txt</h1><p>Workspace konfigurasi khusus · enam lapisan pengaturan</p></header><main><section class="intro"><div class="eyebrow">SEO & SITE DISCOVERY / CONFIGURATION WORKSPACE</div><p>Atur layout, pilihan, penerapan, penyimpanan, folder-file, dan parameter Editor Robots.txt secara terpisah. Setiap lapisan memiliki pengaturan mandiri.</p></section><div class="workspace"><nav class="nav" aria-label="Lapisan konfigurasi"><button class="active" data-tab="layout"><span>LAPISAN 01</span>LAYOUT</button><button class="" data-tab="pilihan"><span>LAPISAN 02</span>PILIHAN</button><button class="" data-tab="penerapan"><span>LAPISAN 03</span>PENERAPAN</button><button class="" data-tab="penyimpanan"><span>LAPISAN 04</span>PENYIMPANAN</button><button class="" data-tab="folder"><span>LAPISAN 05</span>FOLDER & FILE</button><button class="" data-tab="konfigurasi"><span>LAPISAN 06</span>KONFIGURASI</button></nav><div class="stage"><section class="layer active" data-panel="layout"><div class="layer-head"><div><small>LAPISAN 01</small><h2>LAYOUT</h2><p>Atur komposisi, susunan panel, dan lapisan antarmuka.</p></div><b>01</b></div><div class="fields"><label>Tata letak<select data-setting="layout.0"><option>Panel bertingkat</option><option>Kanvas kerja</option><option>Tabel dan detail</option><option>Pratinjau terpisah</option></select></label><label>Kepadatan<select data-setting="layout.1"><option>Ringkas</option><option>Standar</option><option>Lapang</option></select></label><label>Navigasi<select data-setting="layout.2"><option>Tab horizontal</option><option>Sidebar</option><option>Panel bertumpuk</option></select></label></div></section><section class="layer " data-panel="pilihan"><div class="layer-head"><div><small>LAPISAN 02</small><h2>PILIHAN</h2><p>Pilihan khusus untuk kebutuhan fitur ini.</p></div><b>02</b></div><div class="fields"><label>Aturan crawler<select data-setting="pilihan.0"><option>Otomatis</option><option>Manual</option><option>Gunakan templat</option></select></label><label>User-agent<select data-setting="pilihan.1"><option>Standar</option><option>Disesuaikan</option><option>Lanjutan</option></select></label><label>Allow dan Disallow<select data-setting="pilihan.2"><option>Aktif</option><option>Nonaktif</option><option>Ikuti sistem</option></select></label><label>Peta situs<select data-setting="pilihan.3"><option>Default</option><option>Ketat</option><option>Fleksibel</option></select></label></div></section><section class="layer " data-panel="penerapan"><div class="layer-head"><div><small>LAPISAN 03</small><h2>PENERAPAN</h2><p>Atur aktivasi, cakupan, dan validasi sebelum penerapan.</p></div><b>03</b></div><div class="fields"><label>Mode penerapan<select data-setting="penerapan.0"><option>Pratinjau</option><option>Terapkan ke proyek</option><option>Jadwalkan</option></select></label><label>Cakupan<select data-setting="penerapan.1"><option>Halaman aktif</option><option>Seluruh situs</option><option>Pilihan URL</option></select></label><label>Validasi sebelum penerapan<select data-setting="penerapan.2"><option>Wajib</option><option>Peringatan saja</option><option>Lewati</option></select></label><label>Status fitur<select data-setting="penerapan.3"><option>Aktif</option><option>Jeda</option><option>Nonaktif</option></select></label></div></section><section class="layer " data-panel="penyimpanan"><div class="layer-head"><div><small>LAPISAN 04</small><h2>PENYIMPANAN</h2><p>Kelola data, versi konfigurasi, dan ekspor.</p></div><b>04</b></div><div class="fields"><label>Lokasi penyimpanan<select data-setting="penyimpanan.0"><option>Penyimpanan browser</option><option>Ekspor JSON</option><option>Backend terhubung</option></select></label><label>Kebijakan versi<select data-setting="penyimpanan.1"><option>Simpan setiap perubahan</option><option>Simpan manual</option><option>Satu versi terakhir</option></select></label><label>Retensi<select data-setting="penyimpanan.2"><option>30 hari</option><option>90 hari</option><option>Tanpa batas</option></select></label><label>Format ekspor<select data-setting="penyimpanan.3"><option>JSON</option><option>TXT</option><option>CSV</option></select></label></div><div class="actions"><button data-export>Ekspor JSON</button><label class="import">Impor JSON <input type="file" accept="application/json" data-import></label></div></section><section class="layer " data-panel="folder"><div class="layer-head"><div><small>LAPISAN 05</small><h2>FOLDER & FILE</h2><p>Peta folder, manifest, data, dan berkas konfigurasi.</p></div><b>05</b></div><div class="fields"><label>Folder fitur<select data-setting="folder.0"><option>vendordomain/storage/seo/editor-robots-txt/</option></select></label><label>File konfigurasi<select data-setting="folder.1"><option>config.json</option><option>settings.json</option><option>manifest.reic</option></select></label><label>File data<select data-setting="folder.2"><option>data.json</option><option>records.json</option><option>report.json</option></select></label><label>Akses file<select data-setting="folder.3"><option>Baca dan tulis lokal</option><option>Baca saja</option><option>Ekspor saja</option></select></label></div><pre>vendordomain/
└── storage/seo/editor-robots-txt/
    ├── config.json
    ├── manifest.reic
    ├── data/
    └── reports/</pre><p class="muted">Struktur ini adalah peta penyimpanan. Penyimpanan server persisten memerlukan backend.</p></section><section class="layer " data-panel="konfigurasi"><div class="layer-head"><div><small>LAPISAN 06</small><h2>KONFIGURASI</h2><p>Parameter teknis, aturan, dan pemeriksaan lanjutan.</p></div><b>06</b></div><div class="fields"><label>Aturan crawler<select data-setting="konfigurasi.0"><option>Nilai otomatis</option><option>Nilai khusus</option></select></label><label>User-agent<select data-setting="konfigurasi.1"><option>Validasi standar</option><option>Validasi ketat</option></select></label><label>Bahasa antarmuka<select data-setting="konfigurasi.2"><option>Indonesia</option><option>English</option></select></label><label>Pencatatan aktivitas<select data-setting="konfigurasi.3"><option>Aktif</option><option>Nonaktif</option></select></label></div></section><div class="footer-actions"><button id="save">Simpan konfigurasi</button><button id="apply">Validasi & terapkan</button><button id="reset">Pulihkan default</button><button id="exportAll">Unduh konfigurasi</button></div><div class="status" id="status" role="status">Konfigurasi Editor Robots.txt siap disunting.</div></div></div></main><script>
(()=>{const id=358,name="Editor Robots.txt",key="pb-vendordomain-seo-"+id,els=[...document.querySelectorAll("[data-setting]")],tabs=[...document.querySelectorAll("[data-tab]")],panels=[...document.querySelectorAll("[data-panel]")],status=document.querySelector("#status");const read=()=>Object.fromEntries(els.map(e=>[e.dataset.setting,e.value]));const load=s=>els.forEach(e=>{if(s&&s[e.dataset.setting]!==undefined)e.value=s[e.dataset.setting]});const save=()=>{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify({id,name,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString(),settings:read()}));status.textContent="Konfigurasi tersimpan pada penyimpanan browser perangkat ini."};const download=()=>{const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify({schema:"PlanetBintang.VendorDomain.SEO/1",id,name,settings:read()},null,2)],{type:"application/json"}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement("a");a.href=url;a.download="seo-"+id+".json";a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url)};tabs.forEach(t=>t.onclick=()=>{tabs.forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===t));panels.forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x.dataset.panel===t.dataset.tab))});document.querySelector("#save").onclick=save;document.querySelector("#apply").onclick=()=>{if(Object.values(read()).some(x=>!x)){status.textContent="Validasi gagal: lengkapi pilihan.";return}save();status.textContent="Validasi berhasil; penerapan berlaku pada workspace lokal. Sinkronisasi server memerlukan backend."};document.querySelector("#reset").onclick=()=>{els.forEach(e=>e.selectedIndex=0);localStorage.removeItem(key);status.textContent="Pengaturan awal dipulihkan."};document.querySelector("#exportAll").onclick=download;document.querySelector("[data-export]").onclick=download;document.querySelector("[data-import]").onchange=async e=>{try{const d=JSON.parse(await e.target.files[0].text());if(!d.settings)throw Error("Format tidak sesuai");load(d.settings);status.textContent="Impor berhasil; simpan untuk mempertahankan perubahan."}catch(err){status.textContent="Impor gagal: "+err.message}};try{const d=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||"null");if(d)load(d.settings)}catch{};})();
</script></body></html>